{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnySvelteFormApi = AnyFormApi & SvelteTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any> & SvelteFormSelectors<any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L68","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:68"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Svelte form API whose form data and error types are erased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable Svelte components that only need core form operations,\nselectors, and the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Field"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayField"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Subscribe"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormGroup"},{"type":"text","value":"\ncomponents common to every Svelte form. Field paths and values are not\nchecked against a particular form shape; use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SvelteFormType"},{"type":"text","value":" when a\ncomponent depends on one known form."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script lang=\"ts\">\n  const { form }: { form: AnySvelteFormApi } = $props()\n</script>\n\n<form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n  {#snippet children(isSubmitting)}\n    <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n      {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n    </button>\n  {/snippet}\n</form.Subscribe>","lang":"svelte"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnySvelteFormApi = AnyFormApi & SvelteTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any> & SvelteFormSelectors<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L68)\n\nA Svelte form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Svelte components that only need core form operations,\nselectors, and the `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup`\ncomponents common to every Svelte form. Field paths and values are not\nchecked against a particular form shape; use `SvelteFormType` when a\ncomponent depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  const { form }: { form: AnySvelteFormApi } = $props()\n</script>\n\n<form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n  {#snippet children(isSubmitting)}\n    <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n      {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n    </button>\n  {/snippet}\n</form.Subscribe>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnySvelteFormApi\ntitle: AnySvelteFormApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnySvelteFormApi = AnyFormApi & SvelteTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any> & SvelteFormSelectors<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/svelte-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L68)\n\nA Svelte form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Svelte components that only need core form operations,\nselectors, and the `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup`\ncomponents common to every Svelte form. Field paths and values are not\nchecked against a particular form shape; use `SvelteFormType` when a\ncomponent depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  const { form }: { form: AnySvelteFormApi } = $props()\n</script>\n\n<form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n  {#snippet children(isSubmitting)}\n    <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n      {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n    </button>\n  {/snippet}\n</form.Subscribe>\n```\n"}
